% R13. After receiving an item, the picker eventually places it in the slot assigned to that item, unless an emergency occurs.
forall s : SlotId . 
    [ true* . storeOK(s) 
		. !transferItemLiftToPicker(s)*
		. transferItemLiftToPicker(s) ]
    < !pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s), s)*
        . pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s),s) > true
